1. Definitions

"Software" means the Porn Fetch application code, documentation, and original
assets in a release marked with this license, excluding third-party material.
"Premium controls" means the Software's checks for a valid premium credential
and the restrictions those checks apply to premium features. "Bypassed version"
means a version of the Software changed so that premium features can be used
without the credential or entitlement that the unmodified release requires.
"Friends" means people with whom you have an existing personal friendship in
real life and whom you have met in person. Online-only contacts, followers,
subscribers, and members of the same online community do not qualify merely
because of that connection.
"Private sharing" means sharing directly with individual family members or
Friends within your personal circle, including modified copies. You may use
private online messages or a private group consisting only of those people;
the relationships, rather than the delivery method, determine whether sharing
is private.
"Public distribution" means making a copy available beyond Private sharing,
including through a repository, download, mirror, hosted service, or an online
community. Sharing with a Discord server, forum, group chat, or similar community
whose recipients extend beyond that personal circle is Public distribution,
even if membership is restricted or its members are described as friends.

